---
// The buy form's status part (`data-buy-part="status"`): the choice for
// screen readers, and a refused add's problem, announced
// (product-controller.ts). Drawn in the form (ProductSummary.astro) or where a
// product_main skin placed it (`<BuyFormPart name="status" />`).
---

<div class="space-y-2" data-buy-part="status" data-sx-buy="status" data-state="idle">
  <p id="variant-availability-status" data-sx-buy="announcer" class="sr-only" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
</div>
